  "productName": "Stage Monitor",
  "description": "Display band lineup and wireless device",
  "iconDescription": "A dashboard app that pulls musician lineups, photos, and equipment details from Planning Center Online and Shure wireless systems, displaying them on a monitor at a service tech station. The app shows who's performing, their roles (band, production, speakers), RF signal strength, battery charge levels, and slot assignments for wireless microphones and in-ear packs. Think of a stage monitor screen, a mixing console display, a network of connected devices, or a personnel roster board with live status indicators.",
